    "sections": {
        "description": "The Cupcake Shop Theme is a beautifully designed, responsive template crafted for bakeries and dessert businesses. Whether you run a local bakery or a home-based cake business, this theme helps you showcase your creations with charm and elegance. Featuring a pastel color palette, mouthwatering image slots, and sections for menus and seasonal treats, it creates an inviting online presence. Built with clean code and optimized for speed, it ensures a smooth user experience across devices. With WooCommerce compatibility, it supports online orders, gift cards, and delivery options. Additional features include a portfolio section, customer testimonials, and a blog for sharing baking tips or design ideas. SEO-friendly and easy to customize, this theme is perfect for growing your bakery’s online presence and turning visitors into loyal customers."
    },
